                <pb facs="0086" n="80" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg80"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Denby.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 77.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-19"><hi rendition="#italic">November 19,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Our minister Tokyo is advised that any direct overtures for peace made by China
                    to Japan through the American minister at Peking will be considered.</p>
            </div>
